# Indian Diet AI

**AI-powered nutrition and diet recommendation system for Indian food.**

Indian Diet AI combines **RAG, semantic search, Qdrant, Gemini, and calorie calculations** to provide nutrition information and personalized diet recommendations.

---

## Features

* BMR, BMI and TDEE calculation
* Daily calorie target
* Indian food nutrition search
* Semantic search using embeddings
* RAG-based nutrition Q&A
* Gemini AI nutrition assistant
* Personalized Indian diet recommendations
* FastAPI backend
* Streamlit frontend

## Tech Stack

| Category        | Technology            |
| --------------- | --------------------- |
| Language        | Python                |
| Backend         | FastAPI               |
| Frontend        | Streamlit             |
| LLM             | Google Gemini         |
| RAG             | LangChain             |
| Vector Database | Qdrant                |
| Embeddings      | Sentence Transformers |
| Data Processing | Pandas                |

