## Architecture

```text
User
  │
  ▼
Streamlit
  │
  ▼
FastAPI
  │
  ├── Calorie Calculator
  ├── Food Search → Qdrant
  └── RAG → Gemini
  │
  ▼
Nutrition / Diet Recommendation
```

## Setup

### 1. Clone

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/indian-diet-ai.git
cd indian-diet-ai
```

### 2. Create Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

Windows:

```powershell
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

### 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4. Configure Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file:

```env
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key
QDRANT_URL=http://localhost:6333
QDRANT_API_KEY=
API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

### 5. Run Ingestion

```bash
python backend/rag/ingestion.py
```

### 6. Start Backend

```bash
uvicorn backend.main:app --reload
```

### 7. Start Frontend

```bash
streamlit run frontend/app.py
```

## API Endpoints

| Endpoint                 | Method | Description                    |
| ------------------------ | ------ | ------------------------------ |
| `/`                      | GET    | API status                     |
| `/health`                | GET    | Health check                   |
| `/api/calorie/calculate` | POST   | Calculate calorie requirements |
| `/api/food/search`       | GET    | Search food nutrition          |
| `/api/chat`              | POST   | Nutrition Q&A                  |




